name nonumonpart
category Package
revision 22114
shortdesc Prevent page numbers on part pages
relocated 1
longdesc The package bundles the answer to the long-standing FAQ about
longdesc removing page numbers on \part pages. The package accepts no
longdesc options and defines no user commands; the user needs only to
longdesc load it, and the requirement is met.
runfiles size=1
